{"id":"f02918e259cd9a8e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-bm-game.md","title":"Banach–Mazur 博弈的合法局面","display":"df-bm-game — Banach–Mazur 博弈的合法局面","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-bm-game","aliases":["20-df-bm-game"],"display":"df-bm-game — Banach–Mazur 博弈的合法局面","chapter":"14","section":"14.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§14.1.3","source_pdf_pages":[241],"source_printed_pages":[212],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-bm-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-bm-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bm-game — Banach–Mazur 博弈的合法局面"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§14.1.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>241</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_0=\\varnothing\">\\(\\sigma_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>；II 选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_1\">\\(\\sigma_1\\)</span>，I 选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_2\">\\(\\sigma_2\\)</span>，依此交替。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bm\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{LegalBM}((\\sigma_n))\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\sigma_0=\\varnothing\\land\\forall n\\ [\\sigma_n\\prec\\sigma_{n+1}],\\\\\nX((\\sigma_n)):=\\bigcup_n\\sigma_n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WinBM}_I((\\sigma_n),A)\\Longleftrightarrow X((\\sigma_n))\\in A.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bm\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{LegalBM}((\\sigma_n))\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\sigma_0=\\varnothing\\land\\forall n\\ [\\sigma_n\\prec\\sigma_{n+1}],\\\\\nX((\\sigma_n)):=\\bigcup_n\\sigma_n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WinBM}_I((\\sigma_n),A)\\Longleftrightarrow X((\\sigma_n))\\in A.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>策略的输入是完整有限历史，输出合法的严格延伸；winning 指所有遵循该策略的合法无限对局获胜。I 的首步强制为空，II 可选择初始非空柱集。这一约定对两个方向的范畴刻画至关重要。</p>\n<p>来源：§14.1.3；印刷页 212；PDF 第 241 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bm\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{LegalBM}((\\sigma_n))\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\sigma_0=\\varnothing\\land\\forall n\\ [\\sigma_n\\prec\\sigma_{n+1}],\\\\\nX((\\sigma_n)):=\\bigcup_n\\sigma_n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WinBM}_I((\\sigma_n),A)\\Longleftrightarrow X((\\sigma_n))\\in A.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1309,"backlinks":[{"id":"dbd3c82cd2473f13","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]。"},{"id":"088f0b71a9b22ef9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]；see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]；see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-baire-category]]。"},{"id":"c989c60a7c30291e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]；see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435"]}